+> STOP. Captain's notes: non-binding. Captain writes, Captain trims. Anyone else: close this file now.
+
+# Captain Notes
+
+## Completed
+
+- Authored 4 feature files under `features/` covering the full app-spec.md:
+  - `manage-todos.feature` — create, edit, delete, counter, no-todos state (14 scenarios)
+  - `toggle-todos.feature` — complete, mark-all, clear-completed (10 scenarios)
+  - `routing.feature` — hash-based #/ #/active #/completed filter, persist (7 scenarios)
+  - `persistence.feature` — localStorage save/load, id/title/completed keys (9 scenarios)
+- Total: 40 scenarios, all parsed and valid by `cucumber-js --dry-run`.
+- `watchbill.json` with 8 ordered watches mapping every scenario to an implementation target.
+- `js/` and `css/` directories created per spec structure.
