+Feature: Persist Todos
+  As a user
+  I want my todos to persist across page reloads
+  So that I do not lose my tasks
+
+  Background:
+    Given the app is loaded
+
+  Rule: Save to localStorage
+
+  Scenario: Save new todo to localStorage
+    When I type "Buy groceries" into the todo input and press Enter
+    Then "Buy groceries" is saved in localStorage under key "todos-vanilla"
+
+  Scenario: Todo items stored with id, title, and completed properties
+    Given the todo list contains "Buy groceries"
+    When I inspect localStorage
+    Then each stored todo has "id", "title", and "completed" properties
+
+  Scenario: Marking complete updates localStorage
+    Given the todo list contains "Buy groceries"
+    When I click the checkbox on "Buy groceries"
+    Then the stored todo "Buy groceries" has completed set to true
+
+  Scenario: Editing title updates localStorage
+    Given the todo list contains "Buy groceries"
+    When I double-click the label of "Buy groceries"
+    And I change the edit input to "Buy food" and press Enter
+    Then the stored todo "Buy groceries" has title "Buy food"
+
+  Scenario: Deleting todo removes from localStorage
+    Given the todo list contains "Buy groceries"
+    When I click the destroy button on "Buy groceries"
+    Then "Buy groceries" is removed from localStorage
+
+  Scenario: Clear completed updates localStorage
+    Given the todo list contains "Buy groceries"
+    And the todo list contains "Walk the dog"
+    And "Buy groceries" is completed
+    When I click the clear-completed button
+    Then "Buy groceries" is removed from localStorage
+    And "Walk the dog" remains in localStorage
+
+  Rule: Load from localStorage
+
+  Scenario: Load persisted todos on page load
+    Given localStorage contains a todo with title "Buy groceries" and completed false
+    When the app is reloaded
+    Then "Buy groceries" appears in the todo list
+    And its checkbox is not checked
+
+  Scenario: Load completed state from localStorage
+    Given localStorage contains a todo with title "Pay bills" and completed true
+    When the app is reloaded
+    Then "Pay bills" appears in the todo list
+    And it has the completed class
+
+  Scenario: Editing mode is not persisted
+    Given the todo list contains "Buy groceries"
+    When I double-click the label of "Buy groceries"
+    And the app is reloaded without saving the edit
+    Then the todo "Buy groceries" is not in editing mode
\ No newline at end of file
