+Feature: Toggle Todos
+  As a user
+  I want to mark todos as complete and clear completed items
+  So that I can track what is done
+
+  Background:
+    Given the app is loaded
+    And the todo list contains "Buy groceries"
+    And the todo list contains "Walk the dog"
+    And the todo list contains "Pay bills"
+
+  Rule: Complete individual todos
+
+  Scenario: Mark a todo as completed
+    When I click the checkbox on "Buy groceries"
+    Then "Buy groceries" has the completed class
+    And its checkbox is checked
+
+  Scenario: Unmark a completed todo
+    Given "Buy groceries" is completed
+    When I click the checkbox on "Buy groceries"
+    Then "Buy groceries" does not have the completed class
+    And its checkbox is not checked
+
+  Rule: Mark all as complete
+
+  Scenario: Mark all todos as complete
+    When I click the toggle-all checkbox
+    Then all todos have the completed class
+    And the toggle-all checkbox is checked
+
+  Scenario: Toggle-all state updates when individual todos change
+    When I click the checkbox on "Buy groceries"
+    And I click the checkbox on "Walk the dog"
+    And I click the checkbox on "Pay bills"
+    Then the toggle-all checkbox is checked
+
+  Scenario: Toggle-all unchecks when one todo is unchecked
+    Given all todos are completed
+    When I click the checkbox on "Buy groceries"
+    Then the toggle-all checkbox is not checked
+
+  Scenario: Toggle-all clears when all are unchecked
+    Given all todos are completed
+    When I click the toggle-all checkbox
+    Then no todo has the completed class
+    And the toggle-all checkbox is not checked
+
+  Rule: Clear completed
+
+  Scenario: Clear completed removes completed todos
+    Given "Pay bills" is completed
+    When I click the clear-completed button
+    Then "Pay bills" is not in the todo list
+    And "Buy groceries" is in the todo list
+    And "Walk the dog" is in the todo list
+
+  Scenario: Clear completed button is hidden when no completed todos
+    Given no todos are completed
+    Then the clear-completed button is hidden
+
+  Scenario: Clear completed button is visible when completed todos exist
+    Given "Pay bills" is completed
+    Then the clear-completed button is visible
+
+  Scenario: Toggle-all checked state clears after clear completed
+    Given all todos are completed
+    When I click the clear-completed button
+    Then the toggle-all checkbox is not checked
\ No newline at end of file
